### 1️⃣ Demande de réinitialisation
POST http://localhost:8084/api/auth/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "ata2"
}

### 2️⃣ Vérification du code reçu par email
POST http://localhost:8084/api/auth/password-reset/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "ata2",
  "code": "THHP36"
}

### 3️⃣ Confirmation et nouveau mot de passe
POST http://localhost:8084/api/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "ata2",
  "code": "THHP36",
  "newPassword": "T@u1234567891"
}

